{
  "design_id": "T3-6",
  "tier": 3,
  "type": "SEN",
  "description": "Galvanically isolated precision ADC node. VIN_5V powers the non-isolated side, where XC6206 (U1) generates 3.3V for STM32F103 (U3) and the MCU-side supplies of two ISO7721 isolators (U4, U5). External ISO_5V powers REF5050 (U7) and a second XC6206 (U2), which generates ISO_3V3 for ADS1118 (U6) and the isolated-side supplies of the isolators. REF5050 VOUT is monitored by one ADS1118 analog input through an attenuating or signal-conditioning resistor path. ISO7721 devices isolate STM32F103-to-ADS1118 SPI, including ADS1118 return data. GND and ISO_GND must never connect. No isolated DC-DC or RS485 interface is required.",
  "ic_list": [
    "XC6206 (U1)",
    "XC6206 (U2)",
    "STM32F103 (U3)",
    "ISO7721 (U4)",
    "ISO7721 (U5)",
    "ADS1118 (U6)",
    "REF5050 / REF50xx (U7)"
  ],
